  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g504288-d1773988-r1045560115-Discovery_Parks_Cradle_Mountain-Cradle_Mountain_Lake_St_Clair_National_Park_Tas.html",
  "title": "Stay here if you're going to Cradle!",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Loved this place.\nPeaceful.\nWarm.\nClose to Cradle.\nWe stayed in one of the cabins on King Billy Court. We arrived right before the office closed, and safely ensconced ourselves in the warmth of the little two bedroom cabin. We all slept well, then were up early to 'do' Cradle Mountain for the following day (which was AWESOME!) and had to wash the ice off the car before we left! No snow, but a gorgeous hike and a wonderful full day was had. \nWe rested in our warm cabin for a while before heading out to the nearby Hellyers Restaurant for dinner. Pricey but OMG delicious.\nSlept like logs again that night - so quiet!\nSad to leave the next day.\nHighly recommend.\nThe cabins are clean and compact without feeling cramped.",
